{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y的长句缺少X醒目的关键词锚点，扫读不如X轻松，右侧感受也没有X那么丰富、细密地贴合音乐变化。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y整体更好，关键在于它把人物的心理变化、行为动机和前后因果连成了一条完整的线，观众不需要读过原文，也比较容易理解他为什么从小心试探，逐渐敞开心意，又重新害怕失去。尤其S05至S09，Y对人物为什么放松、为什么孤单、为什么开始相信对方也需要自己，以及为什么又担忧未来，都交代得更清楚。X的优势是关键词醒目、音乐细节丰富且有细致的时间对应，但部分感受比较碎片化，个别心理转折也不如Y交代得明白。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "cb1ec83f-a351-426d-9c4b-ca6148247232", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T162321824653Z", "elapsed_seconds": 88.391, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T16:24:50.233923+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "9cee5f0a455874a9e844854e4a712005a331d4768a4dd23b556ccee918dd36ba", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\ch